# The data is kept byte for byte as committed. On Windows git would otherwise turn its line endings into
# CRLF, the file's fingerprint would no longer match models/model_info.json, and the saved models would
# be trained again at every start (see trained_models.why_not_usable).
*.csv -text
*.joblib binary
# The container runs this script on Linux, which needs LF line endings.
*.sh text eol=lf
